## 🗄️ Backend এর জন্য Database Schema (সম্পূর্ণ ডিজাইন)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> নিচে প্রতিটি টেবিলের বিস্তারিত ER Diagram এবং ফিল্ড ডেফিনিশন দেওয়া হলো। এটি `marketplace_provider.dart` এর Data Models থেকে Derived।

### Entity Relationship Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS ||--o{ CREATOR_PROFILES : has
    USERS ||--o{ CLIENT_PROFILES : has
    USERS ||--o{ KYC_DOCUMENTS : submits
    USERS ||--o{ CAMPAIGNS : creates
    USERS ||--o{ GIGS : publishes
    USERS ||--o{ PROPOSALS : submits
    USERS ||--o{ CHAT_MESSAGES : sends
    USERS ||--o{ ORDERS : participates
    USERS ||--o{ WALLET_TRANSACTIONS : has
    USERS ||--o{ NOTIFICATIONS : receives
    
    CAMPAIGNS ||--o{ PROPOSALS : has
    CAMPAIGNS ||--o{ CHAT_THREADS : generates
    
    GIGS ||--o{ CHAT_THREADS : generates
    
    CHAT_THREADS ||--o{ CHAT_MESSAGES : contains
    CHAT_MESSAGES ||--o| CONTRACTS : may_contain
    
    CONTRACTS ||--|| ORDERS : creates
    ORDERS ||--o{ ORDER_DELIVERIES : has
    ORDERS ||--o{ ORDER_REVISIONS : has
    
    USERS ||--|| WALLETS : has
    WALLETS ||--o{ WALLET_TRANSACTIONS : logs
```

