## 🔄 Core Business Logic Flow

### Flow 1: Campaign → Proposal → Contract → Order → Payment

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client/Brand
    participant S as Server
    participant CR as Creator
    
    C->>S: POST /campaigns/create
    S-->>C: Campaign Created ✅
    
    CR->>S: GET /campaigns (browse open)
    S-->>CR: Campaign List
    
    CR->>S: POST /proposals/submit
    S-->>CR: Proposal Submitted ✅
    S-->>C: 🔔 Notification: New Proposal
    
    C->>S: PUT /proposals/{id}/status (accept)
    S-->>C: Proposal Accepted ✅
    S-->>CR: 🔔 Notification: Accepted
    
    Note over C,CR: Chat Thread Auto-Created
    
    C->>S: POST /chats/contracts/send
    S-->>CR: 📋 Contract Message (Title, Budget, Deadline)
    
    CR->>S: PUT /chats/contracts/{id}/respond (accepted)
    S-->>C: Contract Accepted ✅
    
    C->>S: PUT /chats/contracts/{id}/respond (paid)
    Note over S: 💰 Escrow Lock: Client Wallet → Escrow
    S-->>CR: 🔔 Escrow Funded! Start Work
    
    Note over S: 📦 Order Created Automatically
    
    CR->>S: POST /orders/{id}/deliver
    S-->>C: 🔔 Delivery Received!
    
    alt Client Happy
        C->>S: POST /orders/{id}/approve
        Note over S: 💰 Escrow Release → Creator Wallet
        S-->>CR: 🔔 Payment Released! $450 Added
    else Client Wants Changes
        C->>S: POST /orders/{id}/request-revision
        S-->>CR: 🔔 Revision Requested
        CR->>S: POST /orders/{id}/deliver (updated)
    end
```

### Flow 2: Gig → Direct Order

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    participant CR as Creator
    
    C->>S: GET /gigs (browse)
    C->>S: GET /gigs/{id} (details)
    C->>S: POST /chats/threads/create (gig_id)
    Note over C,CR: Chat Thread Created
    C->>S: POST /chats/messages/send (negotiate)
    CR->>S: POST /chats/messages/send (reply)
    C->>S: POST /chats/contracts/send (finalize deal)
    Note over S: Same Contract → Escrow → Order Flow
```

